Port of CrossOver 26.3 Rosetta workarounds that FineWine depends on implicitly (CodeWeavers
CW HACKs 22131, 24256, 24265, 24945, 25719, 18947), rebased onto upstream Wine 11.19:
- NtSetContextThread: report success when debug registers cannot be set under Rosetta.
- Exception contexts: take MXCSR from the live register under Rosetta; reload it after SIGSYS.
- Write/exec faults on executable pages: toggle PROT_EXEC so Rosetta retranslates, then retry.
- NtWriteVirtualMemory: toggle exec on written code pages so Rosetta drops stale translations.
Generated by port/apply_port_cxhacks.py.
